{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0324_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0324_story_06_title", "source_sha256": "ff10a2a3b0a6731d7afd3583fc905de9ea57330d656b13a031e52fc971105ce3", "ja": "太陽系規模のイタズラ！", "zh": "太阳系级别的恶作剧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0324_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0324_story_06_synopsis", "source_sha256": "9ce3ce44398bf28c1b2517c7c8b62244a26ffcba12daae5e7b2dd910e6a8568a", "ja": "亜美に公園に呼び出されるプロデューサー。\nなんとそこには、本番が待ち切れないからと\nゲリラライブを企画していたアイドル達の姿\nが。サプライズと共にライブも成功させ、\n公演本番に向かって拍車を掛けるのだった。", "zh": "制作人被亚美叫到了公园。\n在那里，竟然发现偶像们策划了一场\n因为等不及正式演出而举办的突袭演唱会。\n她们带来惊喜的同时也成功完成了演唱会，\n为正式演出增添了动力。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0324_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0324_story_06_1000_p", "source_sha256": "393f64c6ac3e32104b2503ad360f7bc8f1ab606d2a5f8a31263060deb730568a", "ja": "（今日は久しぶりのオフだ！　といっても、\nなぜか亜美に呼び出されている）", "zh": "（今天是久违的休息日！不过，不知为什么却被亚美叫了出来。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0324_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0324_story_06_1001_p", "source_sha256": "6099ebb163d46ad5c88a7a50336c22faec467a1a4b1941a9a51d62701d00a80c", "ja": "（そういえば最近、みんなして裏で何かしていた\nみたいだったけど……怖いような、楽しみなような）", "zh": "说起来，最近大家好像都在背地里做些什么……真让人有点害怕，又有点期待。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0324_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0324_story_06_1003_011ami", "source_sha256": "c392d43643caa8397693e4ac4576e11ff07e54d4a91c054035a7ee7f606f1de2", "ja": "あ、兄ちゃん来た！　こっちこっち～！", "zh": "啊，哥哥来了！这边这边～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0324_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0324_story_06_1004_p", "source_sha256": "cd618718ab794df23cac710407e54e350eab91a29459fe8df6d25ee500544097", "ja": "亜美、お疲れ様……って、あれ？\nどうしてステージ衣装を……？", "zh": "亚美，辛苦了……咦？\n为什么还穿着舞台服装……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0324_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0324_story_06_1005_012mam", "source_sha256": "dcf28109b8be81ce84a3ba4f985db94ef6a626e7b076837ecf1555221064c26d", "ja": "んっふっふ～♪　なぜでしょうな～。", "zh": "嗯哼哼～♪你猜为什么呀～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0324_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0324_story_06_1006_003mik", "source_sha256": "93ea426e9ea979d564a61e21216af917919e3df9876543d58e04028c0c9ea838", "ja": "やっほー、ミキもいるよ♪　おやすみの日も\nミキに会えて、嬉しい？　あはっ☆", "zh": "呀吼～美希也在哦♪　休息的日子也能\n见到美希，开不开心？啊哈哈☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0324_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0324_story_06_1007_p", "source_sha256": "6686f912d16ef348b0d7bb899464b2cdb3ba6c87c38ec9d161283110feee741b", "ja": "えっ？　みんなステージ衣装で……どうしたんだ？", "zh": "咦？大家都穿着舞台服装……这是怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0324_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0324_story_06_1008_005yay", "source_sha256": "36775f9b0f2ef6a80cd485c4fc6b75ca9dc510545ddb1585faabaca09b4a9916", "ja": "えへへっ、{$P$}！\n実は今日は……みんなでここで、ライブするんです！", "zh": "嘿嘿，{$P$}！\n其实今天……我们要在这里一起举办演唱会！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0324_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0324_story_06_1009_009rit", "source_sha256": "dda48ac76eb8f5644ec9371e865573c2bb3e83f494762418d33bc2664ce92841", "ja": "いわゆる、ゲリラライブですね。\n準備は万端ですよ。", "zh": "也就是所谓的突击演出呢。\n已经准备万全了哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0324_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0324_story_06_1010_p", "source_sha256": "bd5f8c84aaccd47e50cd16ebd4b179d6fc981d5ceb2e2f074a34ff9773ed048c", "ja": "ええっ！？　今日？　ここで？　これから？\nなんでそんな……。", "zh": "诶！？今天？在这里？现在就要？\n怎么突然……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0324_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0324_story_06_1011_011ami", "source_sha256": "f21dbb6d0730108328d5051f5c04ed55e4955018e00fbe35d10ec87588909487", "ja": "兄ちゃん、全力でやれって言ったっしょ？\nだから亜美、考えたんだ～。", "zh": "哥哥，你不是说要全力以赴吗？\n所以亚美就想了想～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0324_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0324_story_06_1012_011ami", "source_sha256": "82fd2b22ea24749f98409d33c60e7f77ce1750bb3cd91ef4a04bdad5d73173e7", "ja": "ツアーを待ちきれないっていうこの気持ちを、\nどうにかステージにぶつけられないかって！", "zh": "这种迫不及待想参加巡演的心情，要怎么才能尽情释放到舞台上呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0324_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0324_story_06_1013_012mam", "source_sha256": "650d2bfde2e731a72579038ef40807a16812a4f57be928f975652949cb3ef36c", "ja": "待ち切れないんだから、やっちゃえばいいよね！\nどうどう兄ちゃん、ビックリした？", "zh": "既然等不及了，那就直接干吧！\n怎么样老哥，吓了一跳吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0324_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0324_story_06_1014_p", "source_sha256": "3c7b8a1e78751d31105865dc4d224d40768205d3f286bdf5f3108673feec9892", "ja": "いや、もちろんビックリしてるけど！\nええと、施設の使用許可とかは……？", "zh": "不，当然很吃惊啊！\n那个，场地的使用许可之类的……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0324_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0324_story_06_1015_009rit", "source_sha256": "5b98204fd1c3e515a5c612934ae2596c82ac9f2a9728ccb844779e0de028c245", "ja": "当然、取ってあります。\n社長も小鳥さんも協力してくれましたからね。", "zh": "当然已经拿到了。\n社长和小鸟小姐也都帮了忙呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0324_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0324_story_06_1016_005yay", "source_sha256": "4d068d24675acf3b60b90104caf74fee11de88819323ae43c1e3ad877083995e", "ja": "亜美がお願いしたんですよ！\nみんなで、サプライズにしたいからーって。", "zh": "是亚美拜托大家的呀！\n因为想和大家一起给你一个惊喜嘛——", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0324_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0324_story_06_1017_003mik", "source_sha256": "844cf0d16caf486e849a4bc5ec139f332e90a4e833a2262c8ea77c5c6ac40286", "ja": "スタッフさんとか、\n機材の用意もバッチリってカンジ☆", "zh": "工作人员，还有设备的准备，也都妥妥的☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0324_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0324_story_06_1018_p", "source_sha256": "b87fc53a5f4fe12264ab4436b98f54dd6efd162e6e3415d63df7719dc0347adf", "ja": "そこまで……みんなでやったのか。", "zh": "做到这种程度……是大家一起完成的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0324_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0324_story_06_1019_009rit", "source_sha256": "0907792bbe3c19e7cb04d40cc745da13a81f418e3efcacd3851676f11c5170aa", "ja": "亜美に「一緒にイタズラして！」って\n言われたときは、こっちもビックリしましたけどね。", "zh": "被亚美说“和我一起恶作剧吧！”的时候，我这边也吓了一跳呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0324_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0324_story_06_1020_003mik", "source_sha256": "20a5e5202b83c535bc99be10dfaec0a369ddf99b7338875eba1f6a6614003618", "ja": "ミキ、すぐ楽しそうって思ったの。\n律子、さんもノリノリだったよね？", "zh": "美希马上就觉得很有意思。律子也很来劲，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0324_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0324_story_06_1021_009rit", "source_sha256": "4744367de1dd5d4d22ac9989f5a4c7fc225384de01bae8fd6625353de661563c", "ja": "亜美に、あんなに真剣にお願いされたらね。\n公演の宣伝になりそうだから、戦略的にも悪くないし。", "zh": "亚美那么认真地拜托我，我也没法拒绝嘛。看起来还能起到宣传公演的作用，从战略上来说也不坏。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0324_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0324_story_06_1022_009rit", "source_sha256": "de97aad77fc68d83faaa9b3ad3f93093fa7c01bf5894934b789c9a6c2713db90", "ja": "それに……。\n待ちきれない気持ちは、私も同じだもの。", "zh": "而且……  \n我也有着迫不及待的心情。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0324_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0324_story_06_1023_011ami", "source_sha256": "e0b5d7b6d16b1e56ce33ccf8d9a6b3ca3e76007c337f023b6f01bfe2626bd043", "ja": "どうどう、兄ちゃん？\nこれなら亜美たち、立派な太陽になれるっしょ？", "zh": "好了好了，哥哥？\n这样一来，亜美她们也能成为出色的太阳了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0324_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0324_story_06_1024_p", "source_sha256": "9ac7cbb3b88c74c1ff04a4366bf23a6913d265adea41b9d2ce2689690589f319", "ja": "……。\nそうか、そういうことか……。", "zh": "……。\n原来是这样啊……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0324_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0324_story_06_1025_009rit", "source_sha256": "c432f228845b311ae7f377531ce2f3c2fcd998f549276b02b038a1b3057046b3", "ja": "ああ、そうそう。{$P$}に、\n社長から伝言です。", "zh": "啊，对了对了。社长有句话要转告给{$P$}。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0324_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0324_story_06_1026_009rit", "source_sha256": "dc688afdac7c3767219a2524efb24aa6d7b5a45d390c53b34b6b3cce76883e4c", "ja": "「ウォッホン！　これはいつも頑張ってくれる君への、\nアイドル諸君からのプレゼントだ」", "zh": "“咳咳！这是各位偶像送给一直努力拼搏的你，\n一份小小的礼物”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0324_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0324_story_06_1027_009rit", "source_sha256": "64b99e978e4e9be24b866d97b76e7d16930242b1a6d00a21568cc991b581afea", "ja": "「たまにはひとりのファンとして、ライブを楽しむのも\n悪くないと思うよ？　それじゃ！」……だそうです。", "zh": "“偶尔作为一个普通的粉丝去享受演出的乐趣，\n我觉得也不错哦？那就这样啦！”……他是这么说的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0324_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0324_story_06_1028_p", "source_sha256": "7b3a3c541f6413f1b586bce56d58479fee6e6159ac26e27bb288cee07ce43d55", "ja": "ひとりのファンとして……か。", "zh": "作为一名普通粉丝……吗。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0324_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0324_story_06_1029_p", "source_sha256": "7faa4d46b7ff56b6f324248f59ba2535110102392fcdfe89f99c82d00d6d7830", "ja": "……ありがとうみんな。\nそれじゃ、お言葉に甘えさせてもらおうかな。", "zh": "……谢谢大家。\n那我就不客气，恭敬不如从命了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0324_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0324_story_06_1030_011ami", "source_sha256": "dafc16c4cf6af921d5fe9bd96d99b4bd6a8c7397c8646bda4a15956759f480a2", "ja": "うんうん！　亜美、今日は兄ちゃんのこと、\nめっちゃビックリさせて、楽しませちゃうかんね！", "zh": "嗯嗯！亜美今天会让哥哥大吃一惊，好好享受一番哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0324_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0324_story_06_1031_012mam", "source_sha256": "df22aaf8157622fabde64945a25a7c09b97c4251faa57129bdf27269f25acf23", "ja": "兄ちゃんは最前列で全力コールして、\nめーっちゃ盛り上げてよね？　よろよろー！", "zh": "哥哥要在最前排全力应援，把现场气氛炒得超级热烈哦？拜托啦——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0324_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0324_story_06_1032_p", "source_sha256": "e07b05118295dbeebc88cc4ba632997c4e21c5d931b47e824dc29c5bc2bbb1fe", "ja": "そ、そうか。うまくできるかな……。\nいや、わかった。全力で盛り上げるよ！", "zh": "这、这样啊。能不能顺利做到呢……  \n不，知道了。我会全力炒热气氛的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0324_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0324_story_06_1033_005yay", "source_sha256": "742d032c960ade1a4f37dd0d893a371e7d1902e9d2d49b4b85a5b6025513040a", "ja": "うっうー！　みんなで、ちゃんとツアー本番の\n宣伝もしちゃいますからね！", "zh": "呜呜——！大家也会好好为巡演正式演出\n做宣传的哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0324_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0324_story_06_1034_003mik", "source_sha256": "92c3d5ecea7e9fb459973f957c8625f5ce7b6a5a96ceab90f84c88c20f369921", "ja": "今日はファンの人だから、ライブが終わったら、握手会\nしようね。ミキとふたりっきりで……、あはっ☆", "zh": "今天来的都是粉丝，所以演唱会结束后，和大家一起办握手会吧。和美希两个人单独……啊哈☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
